WEBVTT

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.430
Hey, Natsuki!

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:14.700
Mattsun.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.910
Morning.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.140
What's the matter?

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.950
You've got bags under your eyes.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.290
I couldn't sleep at all last night.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.380
Oh, were you up fantasizing about something?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.220
Uh, n-no!

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.640
Let me give you a tip.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.550
A tip!?

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.400
About the big ferris wheel in the park.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.230
It's got one car that's heart-shaped.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.960
Ride in it, and your love will be true.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.650
Couples who ride in it
stay together a long time.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.590
What? ls that true?

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:46.980
Yeah, totally.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.820
Well, every place has stories like that.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.740
But do what you can to
finish off our trip by riding it.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.470
I'll handle the Spitting Woman for you!

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:55.410
Mattsun!

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:56.740
Thank you!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.330
I'll try asking her!

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.430
Yeah, good luck!

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.920
Oh, wait...

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:05.120
If it's just the one heart-shaped car...

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.320
...how do we get it?

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:09.500
Dumb luck.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.050
L-Luck, huh?

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.970
Uh, hold on.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.810
What is Nozomi doing here?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.950
I'd planned to invite her all along.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.270
Na-chan, good morning!

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.540
Morning.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.650
No wonder you headed out so early!

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.190
Don't tell me you were avoiding me!

00:02:59.190 --> 00:02:59.620
M-Morning. Kobayakawa-san!

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.120
I wasn't! You just wouldn't wake up!

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.080
Good morning.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.160
It's a lovely weather.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:05.910
Hey.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.000
We're boarding the bus.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.020
Anna, want one?

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:10.870
Sure.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.390
I wish I could have sat next to Keiichi-san...

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:16.880
No way.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.480
We're here!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.900
Let's do some rides!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.070
Before that, we need to
drop off our bags at the hotel.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.750
Oh, right.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.050
Nozomi!

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.370
C-Coming.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.260
Now then.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.090
Where's the concert site?

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:57.440
Huh? Is the concert starting already?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.860
Hm? No, there's still time.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.600
But we need to go early to get a good spot!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.090
Yeah.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.480
Sure thing.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.700
Then we'll go ride...

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.760
Ah, the ferris—

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.680
The roller coaster!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.650
You said it!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.990
<i>Oh, right... It's better to do
the ferris wheel last.</i>

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.730
<i>Almost got ahead of myself.</i>

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.450
H-How about you, Kobayakawa-san?
Are you okay with thrill rides?

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:20.210
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.790
How about you, Spitting Woman?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.750
Can you you handle them?

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.250
I've never been on one before,
but I'll be just fine!

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.590
As long as Anna's with me!

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.620
Next, please.

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:36.040
Please watch your step.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.830
Onii-chan...

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.970
Um...

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.100
I'm scared.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.140
What? But you used to ride these in grade school!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.300
I could only go on the kiddie rides
because of the height restrictions.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.650
Nozomi-chan, you're not gonna ride?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.370
No, sorry.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.270
It's a bit too scary, so I'll just wait here.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.360
There's nothing to worry about.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.000
It's only scary at first.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.560
Then you'll start having fun!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.450
Really?

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.410
Yeah, you'll get used to it.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:15.500
If you say so, Keiichi-san,
then... I'll try it.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.130
Yeah. Nothing to be afraid of.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.930
Mattsun, sit down already.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.400
The ride is starring!

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:41.450
Welcome back.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:44.160
Please wait for the ride
to come to a complete stop.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.490
Nozomi-chan, how was it?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.860
It... It was fun!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:50.950
I know, right?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.540
I'm glad you liked it!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:53.330
Me too!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.270
It was just as Keiichi-san said!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:14.120
What next? Go-karts, maybe?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.570
Hold on, Kei-chan.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.200
Wow...

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.450
Maybe we went overboard with all the rides...

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.700
You okay?

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:25.860
Want to rest at the hotel?

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.790
I'm fine as long as Anna's with me...

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.030
Yeah. Sure.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.800
I lost track of how many
Dosanko Crankies I had to get.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.140
Same here!

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:45.060
But I'm so glad we won!

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:47.760
We were super, super, super lucky!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.820
I'll go make some coffee.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:57.820
Mm-hm...

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.200
Huh?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.250
There's no Volume 4?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.320
Must be in here...

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:21.920
Uh, Mari-chan?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:23.630
Where are you going?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.180
The restroom.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.800
I'll come with you.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.610
Yeah.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.520
Do you think she's okay?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.980
Probably.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:37.060
Kobayakawa-san's with her and all.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.820
Good point.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.100
Huh? Look at that.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.390
Ah, Tsutsui-san!

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.410
She looks pretty bad!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.450
I'll go check on her!

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:46.310
Don't bother.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:49.440
There's nothing we men
can do at a time like this.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.650
Let her be.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.500
That's our expert!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.210
How's he an expert?

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:56.580
Because he's always with girls—

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.580
Because I'm always helping girls out.

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:03.000
Mari-chan, I'll be waiting out here.

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:04.960
If it gets bad, call me.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.670
Mm-hm.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.160
Will she be okay?

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.560
What should I do?

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.940
Maybe I should take her back to the hotel

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.360
and get her some medicine.

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.640
Hey.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.310
You alone?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.150
No, I'm waiting on my friend.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.200
Yeah, we know!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.190
We were watching!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.490
Is your friend okay?

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.620
If she's feeling sick, did you know
there's a medical office?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.380
You can get medicine there.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:35.960
Really?

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.530
I'll show you the way.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.130
But I have to wait for Mari-chan.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.450
Don't worry. This guy will stay here.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:43.960
Let's go.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.870
Um, hey...

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.290
Thank you for riding with us.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:53.400
What do you think of my driving skills?

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:54.980
Sorry, I wasn't watching.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:56.560
That was hard...

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.340
Hey, what should we do next?

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:01.010
Well, next let's...

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.390
Kobayakawa-san!?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.320
Who is that man?

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.820
So, where is Anna?!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.490
My buddy went with her to get medicine.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:14.360
Where?!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.410
I'm asking you, where is the medical office?

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:20.260
Natsuki.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:21.130
Yes?

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:24.250
I'd say this is a time when
there is something we men can do.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.350
No kidding!

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.850
Here we go, everyone!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.530
Wait, who are you, anyway?!

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:52.040
Where's Anna?!

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:55.110
Okay, I'll take you where my buddy is.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.910
Then hurry up!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.240
Mari-chan.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:09:59.410
Anna!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.750
Are you feeling better now?

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:02.860
Mari-chan.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.000
Excuse me...

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:08.750
Did you need something?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.220
No, she looked like
she wasn't feeling well.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.920
Sorry to bother you!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.220
Picking up girls at a spot like this? Lame.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:19.850
And you were this close to go with him.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:20.730
Be more careful.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:21.730
Sh-Shut up!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:22.470
Take your hand off me!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.520
Hey...!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.640
I helped you out! Where's my "thank you"?

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.620
Huh?! Why would I have to say that to—

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.840
This is what happens when you make
such fuss while not feeling well.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.450
Wait... That was an accident.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.460
How I wish...

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:46.200
...you'd just die already!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.660
Ow, that hurt!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.940
Let's go on that ride!

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:02.680
Later, okay?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.450
The ferris wheel...

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.490
Um...

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:15.940
Weren't we going to the medical office?

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.620
I forget where it is.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.190
Let's look for it from up high.

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:21.820
But...

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:29.520
Kobayakawa-san!
